    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p></p><br><h1>DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>You play as a very lazy capybara who has to climb a mountain to take a bath in his barrel!</strong><br><br>It seemed that the capybara had already accepted her fate of not being able to take a bath. Prepare for the falls, try not to fall and keep going. Travel through different eras and reach the top of the mountain!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/09e3490aed36a59dda069e48473c4dea.poster.avif?t=1725017725\" width=300 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/09e3490aed36a59dda069e48473c4dea.webm?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/09e3490aed36a59dda069e48473c4dea.mp4?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/f29ad7912d09502fed4aee8b1d6e4da7.poster.avif?t=1725017725\" width=300 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/f29ad7912d09502fed4aee8b1d6e4da7.webm?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/f29ad7912d09502fed4aee8b1d6e4da7.mp4?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You have a rope with a barrel to balance while climbing.<br>Use all your experience to hold on to the capybara.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/99341254407f1d5af77b4133a7e70f5d.poster.avif?t=1725017725\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/99341254407f1d5af77b4133a7e70f5d.webm?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>There are several locations in the game: <br>  \ud83d\udc2a Walk through ancient architecture!<br>  \u2694\ufe0f See medieval houses and walk through narrow streets!<br>  \ud83c\udf35 Wild West - Walk through a small base and out into the mines!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/e7820bce4db6b7e2b54e1f843c69c8cf.poster.avif?t=1725017725\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/e7820bce4db6b7e2b54e1f843c69c8cf.webm?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>  \ud83c\udf5cThe City - Stroll down an anime inspired street! <br>  \u26f0\ufe0f Climb a mountain and take a bath!<br>  \u262f If you suddenly fall off the mountain, there's a small chance you'll end up on the roof of a steampunk building!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/eaa345e6de85f9abd827cca2bbe6675f.poster.avif?t=1725017725\" width=606 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/eaa345e6de85f9abd827cca2bbe6675f.webm?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>You play as a very lazy capybara who has to climb a mountain to take a bath in his barrel!</strong><br><br>It seemed that the capybara had already accepted her fate of not being able to take a bath. Prepare for the falls, try not to fall and keep going. Travel through different eras and reach the top of the mountain!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/09e3490aed36a59dda069e48473c4dea.poster.avif?t=1725017725\" width=300 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/09e3490aed36a59dda069e48473c4dea.webm?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/09e3490aed36a59dda069e48473c4dea.mp4?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/f29ad7912d09502fed4aee8b1d6e4da7.poster.avif?t=1725017725\" width=300 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/f29ad7912d09502fed4aee8b1d6e4da7.webm?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/f29ad7912d09502fed4aee8b1d6e4da7.mp4?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You have a rope with a barrel to balance while climbing.<br>Use all your experience to hold on to the capybara.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/99341254407f1d5af77b4133a7e70f5d.poster.avif?t=1725017725\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/99341254407f1d5af77b4133a7e70f5d.webm?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>There are several locations in the game: <br>  \ud83d\udc2a Walk through ancient architecture!<br>  \u2694\ufe0f See medieval houses and walk through narrow streets!<br>  \ud83c\udf35 Wild West - Walk through a small base and out into the mines!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/e7820bce4db6b7e2b54e1f843c69c8cf.poster.avif?t=1725017725\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/e7820bce4db6b7e2b54e1f843c69c8cf.webm?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>  \ud83c\udf5cThe City - Stroll down an anime inspired street! <br>  \u26f0\ufe0f Climb a mountain and take a bath!<br>  \u262f If you suddenly fall off the mountain, there's a small chance you'll end up on the roof of a steampunk building!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/eaa345e6de85f9abd827cca2bbe6675f.poster.avif?t=1725017725\" width=606 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732980/extras/eaa345e6de85f9abd827cca2bbe6675f.webm?t=1725017725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
